  (text "CRITICAL SAFETY ARCHITECTURE.\n1. Main motor traction power is energized/cut by an independent hardwired safety chain (safety relay / contactor).\n   The MCU only senses E-stop status and never has software authority to bypass the emergency stop.\n2. Main battery fuse, wire gauge, and pack capacity are TBD placeholders awaiting physical robot inspection.\n3. All battery-connected components are rated >= 40V (6S operating window: 18.0V - 25.2V)." (at 25 140 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "83910dd9-7b31-43d3-a6a5-a00000000009"))
